    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        236,
        2407,
        2075,
        2795
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It has been the Mayor's strong belief that the City require of itself at least what it requires of private industry. We expect the City Commission to use the techniques that have brought dramatic rises in equal opportunity in private industry to design affirmative action programs for City agencies that may have any lingering problems. We will make available to you the results of the current survey as soon as they",
